contentText:
Talk about the Call of Cthulhu &#8212; or in this case, CAThulhu! Deadmau5 shared in an Instagram post on Tuesday (June 16), that he&#8217;s adding a fourth feline member to his family &#8212; and during Adopt a Cat Month at that.

